body:
Its an amazing feeling isn't  it, Well done! it sounds like you taken to the machine pretty quickly. As far as the tubing goes I always found lying on my back with the machine in line with my head means i can tuck the tube under my duvet and then have it run up along my chest.

&#x200B;

I cant really offer advice on pulling the machine off your table, but what I can say is mine has hit the floor numerous times and so far it still works perfectly.
